title: "ai-failure-review-agent — 실패 유형 기반 AI 검토 에이전트"
abstract: "A public learning peer-review agent that reviews AI outputs by failure type and helps humans verify citations, numbers, context, and accountability. Ten failure patterns with 100 synthetic cases, verification checklists, a review-sheet generator and checker, and a browser page that shows the five-gate review loop (demo by default; optional real-model review with the user's own API key). Synthetic examples only; no real data."
authors:
